1
00:00:00,171 --> 00:00:02,114
In one kingdom,
refusing a gift is

2
00:00:02,134 --> 00:00:03,139
an insult.

3
00:00:03,159 --> 00:00:05,450
In another,
accepting it is.

4
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:07,147
In Adren,
a gift binds two

5
00:00:07,167 --> 00:00:08,084
families.

6
00:00:08,104 --> 00:00:10,354
Refusing says you'll
never need them.

7
00:00:10,374 --> 00:00:11,822
Across the river,
in Vesk,

8
00:00:11,842 --> 00:00:13,259
a gift is a debt.

9
00:00:13,279 --> 00:00:15,351
Accepting says you
can be bought.

10
00:00:15,371 --> 00:00:16,776
So the envoy offers.

11
00:00:16,796 --> 00:00:18,628
The magistrate
refuses.

12
00:00:18,648 --> 00:00:19,608
Both are polite.

13
00:00:19,628 --> 00:00:21,345
Both are insulted.

14
00:00:21,777 --> 00:00:23,382
Write the rule and
the reason,

15
00:00:23,402 --> 00:00:25,582
and the conflict
writes itself.

16
00:00:25,778 --> 00:00:27,533
Share this with a
writer who wants

17
00:00:27,553 --> 00:00:29,933
believable cultural
differences.
